# Scenario 'register_hidden': the full initial registration of 'register' but the first A ("初期登録開始") is pressed together with B+SELECT+RIGHT.
# 65:42A3 (and 65:42C3) test `hJoyHeld & $16 == $16` right after the first notice page returns; when the combination is held the wizard
# stores 1 in [C28C] and jumps to 65:4455. Visible difference (screenshots): after the mail address the wizard asks "電話番号入力方法選択"
# (自動で入力する / 手動で入力する, the same 67:xxxx code as the hidden モバイルせってい entry 電話番号の変更) and takes the automatic choice.
# Blank cartridge and blank adapter, fake Internet. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400                     # boot: adapter check ("モバイルアダプタGBをチェックしています")
gap 20
taplen 30
tap A+B+SELECT+RIGHT         # "初期登録開始" with the hidden combination held
taplen 4
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "初期登録のご注意" 1/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 2/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 3/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "料金のご注意"
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "ログインID入力" example screen
waitstable 40 max 200
shot login_id_keypad
tap A x10                    # 10 digits '1' -> field full, auto-advances to mail address
waitstable 40 max 200
shot mail_intro
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
tap A x8                     # local part (8 chars) ...
tap A x4                     # ... then sub-domain part (4 chars) -> cursor jumps to OK
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 40 max 200
shot phone_method
tap A                        # 電話番号入力方法選択 (hidden step): 自動で入力する
waitstable 40 max 200
shot password_intro
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
# password "aZ01": a, Z, 0, 1
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START                    # jump to OK
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot password_confirm
# re-enter the same password
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot password_save_confirm
tap A                        # "はい" (save password)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot register_summary
tap A                        # "はい"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot connect_confirm
tap A                        # "はい": dial DION (#9677), PPP, DNS, POP3 login check
wait 600
waitstable 60 max 900
shot registration_result
wait 300
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot welcome_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot welcome_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_3
